  "description": "Explainable OFAC sanctions name screening for .NET. Loads the official SDN list, scores names on OFAC's 0-100 scale using Jaro-Winkler and Soundex, also matches the email addresses, phone numbers, websites and crypto addresses OFAC lists, and explains every match. Zero dependencies; runs on .NET Framework 4.7.2+ (tested on 4.8) and modern .NET.",
